  "identity": "GRINWICK is a soot-black SPIDER LOCOMOTIVE, not a humanoid. Round squat iron boiler, cracked white porcelain grinning faceplate, TWO red lantern eyes, short smokestack, brass pressure fittings and EIGHT jointed spider legs with big brass knees and iron feet. Red coal fire glints, little train buffers beneath grin. Keep all eight legs, broad low stance and comic fixed grin. Existing tiny boiler reference defines its face.",
